[I] D-Bus daemon to bound resource usage of background applications

[T] uresourced dynamically assigns a resource allocation to the active
[T] graphical session, using systemd managed cgroups to protect core session
[T] processes by bounding the memory (and other resource) usage of background
[T] applications on the system.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/benzea/uresourced

[A] Benjamin Berg
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/system

[L] LGPL
